        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 925RT, Modern Lever with Modern Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Omnia, the 925RT lever is both modern and sleek looking. The contemporary design paired with the rectangular rosette makes it a great choice to bring any space into the present day. The Omnia modern lever with rectangular rose is available in 8 finishes including satin brass, satin chrome, polished nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. Available for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 925RT Modern Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>28° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 925RT Modern Lever with Rectangular Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Door Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Lever with Rectangular Rose, Omnia 925RT",
